# INVWINBA.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY, run with
# /CFG:BYCAT.CFG, a settings file that is not there, on the items of
# TEST/KEYS/BYCAT.REQ, three of SYS, two of CARD, one of DRV: the
# categories with their items beside them.  Items > Browse by category
# shows the ten categories, its entry checked, and beside them the items
# of the first, SYS, where Items > New item adds one of SYS, shown
# beside it at once; DOWN, and MOBO has none: F6 gives its empty items
# the focus, where INS shows a new item of MOBO, left by ESC.  On CARD
# the items are its two; F6, and the count, the Record menu and the tool
# bar are theirs.  Item 6 edited there into DRV leaves the list at once,
# and DRV, selected next, has it.  Next order sorts DRV's items by
# location, item 6 first; Move from the items moves it to the office,
# the categories left as they are; INS adds an item of DRV.  The
# Categories dialog, opened over DRV's items, adds AA, which sorts
# first: DRV stays selected a row lower and its items keep the focus;
# opened again over the items of AA, none, it deletes AA: the
# categories take the focus, on the row AA had.  On the categories INS
# adds MISC, selected at the end with no items; CTRL-E renames it and
# orders it first, where it is selected again; DEL asks, No keeping it
# and Yes deleting it, noted.  ENTER on CBL opens its items as a screen
# of their own, empty, where INS adds one; its parts and ESC come back
# to it, where the dialog renames CBL and the title follows, and ESC to
# the categories, CBL selected with that item beside it.  View > Pane
# beside the list shows the categories alone, CBL still selected, and
# selected still, a row lower, once the dialog has added AB above it,
# which it then deletes, ENTER
# and ESC as before, and again with the items; the splitter dragged
# right widens the categories.  The Items menu's fifth entry shows its
# help, and ESC on the categories opens the item list, the entry of its
# order checked.  MOBO's items, none, opened as a screen of their own,
# stay while the dialog deletes MOBO, and ESC opens the categories on
# their first row, the one left being gone.  The end by Exit:
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/BYCAT.CFG is the
# settings file it leaves.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINBA.SNP is its
# snapshot; TEST/framchk.py checks it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-I T
S CATS
K ALT-I N
T SYS
K ALT-M
T Zenith
K ENTER
S FROMCATS
K DOWN
S NOITEMS
K F6
S EMPTY
K INS
S NEWMOBO
K ESC ESC DOWN DOWN
S FOLLOW
K F6
S PANE
K DOWN CTRL-E
S ITEMFORM
T DRV
K ENTER
S RECAT
K ESC DOWN
S DRV
K F6 ALT-C R
S ORDER
K ALT-C M
T OFF
K ENTER
S MOVED
K INS
S NEWITEM
K ALT-M
T Seagate
K ENTER
S ADDED
K ALT-I C ALT-N
T AA
K TAB
T First
K TAB
T 0
K ENTER ESC
S ABOVE
K ESC HOME F6
S OVERAA
K ALT-I C DEL Y ESC
S AAGONE
K INS
S NEWCAT
T MISC
K TAB
T Odds and ends
K TAB
T 60
K ENTER
S CATADDED
K CTRL-E
S CATFORM
T Miscellany
K TAB
T 1
K ENTER
S CATSAVED
K DEL
S ASKMISC
K N
S KEPT
K DEL Y
S CATGONE
K END UP ENTER
S ALONE
K INS
S ALONENEW
K ALT-M
T Belkin
K ENTER
S ALONEADD
K ALT-C P
S PARTS
K ESC
S UNPARTS
K ALT-I C END UP ALT-E
T Leads
K ENTER ESC
S RETITLED
K ESC
S BACK
K ALT-V P
S HIDDEN
# CBL kept by the dialog over the categories alone: AB added above it,
# then deleted
K ALT-I C ALT-N
T AB
K TAB
T Second
K TAB
T 0
K ENTER ESC
S HIDKEPT
K ALT-I C DEL Y ESC
K ENTER
S OPENED
K ESC ALT-V P
S SHOWN
M 220 DOWN MID
M 220 MOVE MID 60 0
M 220 UP MID 60 0
S DRAGGED
K ALT-I DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN
S HELP
K ESC ESC ESC
S ITEMS
# the category left deleted meanwhile: ESC opens the first row
K ALT-I T DOWN ENTER
S MOBO
K ALT-I C DOWN DEL Y ESC ESC
S MOBOGONE
K ALT-F X
